Author: Keith Ballinger <keithballinger@google.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 3 03:18:16 2025 -0700

    feat(hud): add tool execution formatting and approval mode toggle
    
    - Add ToolExecution model to track tool execution state and output
    - Create ToolExecutionView component for proper tool display formatting
    - Add approval mode toggle in header bar (Auto/Ask permission)
    - Update IPC server to support approval mode switching
    - Add tool event streaming from CLI to HUD
    - Separate tool executions from message content in conversation view
    - Add pending tool approval UI with approve/reject buttons
    - Track active tool executions and update their status in real-time
    
    The HUD now properly formats tool executions as separate UI components
    instead of appending them to message content. Users can switch between
    automatic tool execution (YOLO mode) and manual approval mode.
, "success": 1, "name": run_shell_command]
